{{Nihongo|{{ill|Ōtataneko|ja|大田田根子命|fr}}|太田田根子}} was a Japanese mythological figure<ref>{{Cite web |last=KansaiOdyssey |date=2017-07-26 |title=Oh Gods! The Tales of Omononushi |url=https://kansai-odyssey.com/oh-gods-the-tales-of-omononushi/ |access-date=2023-10-03 |website=Kansai Odyssey |language=en-US}}</ref> He is the traditional ancestor of the {{ill|Miwa clan|en}}.<ref name="chamberlain-basil-1882a" />

